  "solenoids": {
    "_": [
      "Spike 2 coil [node, index] -> the SMALL number the table script sees it as. core.vbs",
      "indexes SolCallback(68), SolPrevState(68) and friends by solenoid number, so a coil",
      "needs a number in 1..68 here; the flippers keep core.vbs's own Consts (sLRFlipper 46,",
      "sLLFlipper 48, sULFlipper 36). The controller reports a coil under this number; its",
      "1000+node*16+index name answers Controller.Solenoid(n) only."
    ],
    "1":  {"coil": [8, 1], "name": "TROUGH", "callback": "SolRelease"},
    "2":  {"coil": [8, 4], "name": "AUTO PLUNGER", "callback": "Auto_Plunger"},
